  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">spicy nuts bring fire and comfort in every bite, with cinnamon, smoked paprika, and cayenne playing in vibrant harmony. Toasted almonds, cashews, and pecans shimmer in a honey maple glaze brightened by a splash of apple cider vinegar. Each handful crackles with warm sweetness and gentle heat that lingers like an old friend’s laughter. Perfect by the fireplace or passed around the coffee table, this playful snack delivers a crowd-pleasing punch. Whisk it together in minutes and enjoy for hours as spicy nuts turn ordinary mixed nuts into a joy-sparking feast.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-spicy-nuts\">Why You’ll Love This spicy nuts</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-spicy-nuts\">How to Make Spicy Nuts</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-spicy-nuts\">Pro Tips for Making spicy nuts</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-spicy-nuts\">How to Serve this spicy nuts</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-spicy-nuts\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This spicy nuts</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Irresistibly crunchy and packed with flavor.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Perfect for snacking or as a party appetizer.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Customizable heat levels to suit your taste.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Nutritious mix of healthy fats and protein.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Quick and easy to make at home!</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-7181\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"7181\" data-servings=\"4\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe wprm-recipe-template-meadow\"><div class=\"wprm-layout